	"在 main() 外声明 variable，再用雷达 onDetected 绑定它。\n事件自动更新目标；无目标为 null，有目标时读取 Angle() 射击。\n没有目标时短步前进；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Declare a variable above main() and bind it with radar.onDetected.\nEvents update the target automatically; check for null before firing with Angle().\nAdvance in short steps when no target is visible. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
