	"本关最多安装 3 个模块，继续使用移动、雷达和射击沿主通道推进，击毁全部 10 波敌人。\n\n这次解锁雷达事件：发现敌人后自动更新变量，不必在循环中反复调用 scan()。": "Install up to 3 modules: movement, radar, and shooting. Advance along the main corridor and destroy all 10 waves.\n\nRadar events are now unlocked. They update a variable automatically when an enemy is detected, so your loop no longer needs repeated scan() calls.",
	"在 main() 外先写 variable target = null，再写 radar.onDetected { EnemyPosition -> target }。radar 是你给雷达模块起的名称。\n\n箭头后的 target 必须是前面声明的全局 variable；事件在本次运行开始时注册一次。": "Above main(), write variable target = null, followed by radar.onDetected { EnemyPosition -> target }. radar is the name of your radar module.\n\nThe target after the arrow must be a global variable declared earlier. The event is registered once when the program starts.",
	"EnemyPosition 提供包含敌人位置、方向和距离的目标快照。事件会在每个逻辑 tick 更新 target；没有可见目标时，target 会恢复为 null。\n\n在 main() 中先判断 target != null，再用 gun.shoot(target.Angle()) 射击。不要在循环里重新声明同名的 target。": "EnemyPosition supplies a target snapshot with the enemy position, angle, and distance. The event updates target each logical tick; when no target is visible, target becomes null.\n\nIn main(), check target != null before firing with gun.shoot(target.Angle()). Do not declare another target variable inside the loop.",
	"有目标时持续射击；无目标时用 drive.move(90, 0.1) 短步向上前进。接近下一组支道才会激活新的敌人。\n\n敌人耐久更高，需多次命中并击毁全部模块。远离栅栏，避免近战攻击。": "Keep firing while a target is visible. Otherwise advance upward in short steps with drive.move(90, 0.1). New enemies activate when you reach the next pair of tunnels.\n\nEnemies have greater durability and require repeated hits to destroy every module. Keep away from the bars to avoid melee attacks.",
	"移动扫描 · 隔栏射击": "Scan & Fire · Advance",
