	"main() 已结束。请用 loop 交替扫描、射击与前进，清除全部支道中的敌人。": "main() has finished. Use loop to scan, fire, and advance until all side tunnels are cleared.",

	"第十四关 · 通道清剿": "Level 14 · Corridor Sweep",
	"墙壁": "Wall",
