	"用 loop 反复扫描；有目标时射击，没有目标时短步向上移动。\n铁栅栏阻挡机器，但允许雷达、子弹与近战攻击通过。\n消灭全部 10 波；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Scan repeatedly in loop. Fire at a target, otherwise take a short step upward.\nBars block machines, but let radar, bullets, and melee attacks through.\nClear all 10 waves. Ctrl+Enter runs.",
