	"attack_block 必须是布尔值": "attack_block must be a boolean",
	"本关最多安装 3 个模块，使用移动、雷达和射击沿主通道向上推进。两侧细支道各有敌人，共 10 波。\n\n目标是击毁全部敌人的所有模块；到达道路尽头并不直接通关。": "Use up to 3 modules: movement, radar, and shooting. Advance upward through the main corridor. Enemies occupy the narrow tunnels on both sides, in 10 waves.\n\nDestroy every enemy module to win. Reaching the end alone does not complete the level.",
	"建议先安装雷达 radar 作为装配原点 (0,0)，右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击 gun，左侧 (-0.5,0) 安装移动 drive。\n\n雷达方向从实际雷达中心计算，子弹从实际枪口发射。此布局便于向两侧支道瞄准。": "Place radar first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), gun at (0.5,0), and drive at (-0.5,0).\n\nRadar angles originate at the radar; bullets originate at the gun. This layout helps aim into the tunnels on both sides.",
	"铁栅栏封住支道入口，玩家和敌人的机器都无法穿过，但子弹和近战攻击可以通过。雷达也能穿过栅栏扫描。\n\n支道之间的墙壁会遮挡雷达和攻击，不要把墙壁当作栅栏。": "Iron bars seal the side tunnels. Neither player nor enemy machines can pass, but bullets, melee attacks, and radar can.\n\nWalls between the tunnels block both radar and attacks. Walls do not behave like bars.",
	"把 variable target = radar.scan() 写入 loop。先检查 target != null，再把 target.Angle() 交给 gun.shoot(...)。\n\n每次重新扫描，避免一直使用敌人移动前的位置。": "Put variable target = radar.scan() inside loop. Check target != null, then pass target.Angle() to gun.shoot(...).\n\nScan again each time to avoid aiming at an outdated position.",
	"没有发现敌人时，用 drive.move(90, 0.1) 短步向上前进；发现敌人后停下并持续射击。\n\n接近下一组支道时才会出现新的敌人。每个分支都要有动作，不能只扫描而不推进时间。": "When no enemy is visible, move upward in short steps with drive.move(90, 0.1). Stop and keep firing when a target appears.\n\nNew enemies appear as you reach the next pair of tunnels. Each branch needs an action so time can advance.",
	"敌人的移动和近战模块都有较高耐久，需要多次命中。击毁一个模块后继续扫描射击，直到整台敌人被摧毁。\n\n清除当前敌人后，沿主通道继续前进；远离栅栏，留意敌人的近战攻击。": "Both enemy movement and melee modules have high durability and need repeated hits. Continue scanning and firing after destroying one module, until the entire enemy is defeated.\n\nAfter clearing an enemy, continue along the main corridor. Keep away from the bars and watch for melee attacks.",
	"本关最多持续 240 秒。已击毁数量包含全部 10 波，尚未出现的敌人仍需要清除。\n\n整台敌人被击毁后，残骸约 3 秒淡出。暂停冻结战斗和淡出；重置恢复全部波次，并保留代码与装配。": "You have up to 240 seconds. All 10 waves count toward completion, including enemies that have not appeared yet.\n\nDefeated enemies fade over about 3 seconds. Pause freezes combat and fading; reset restores all waves while keeping your code and assembly.",

