	"地图尺寸已更新；范围外的地块、起点与终点会被移除。可撤销恢复。": "Map size updated. Out-of-bounds tiles, start and finish are removed; Undo can restore them.",
	"空白地图已创建。绘制地板后，用场景控制放置起点；终点可按需添加。": "Blank map created. Paint the floor, then use Scene Controls to place the start. Add a finish if needed.",
	"画笔可连续绘制；框选拖出范围后松开填充，右键擦除为 void。起点与终点使用独立按钮，单击放置，右键或 Esc 返回地形绘制。终点可选，没有终点也能保存和测试。用 − / + 或滚轮缩放。": "Paint continuously, or drag a rectangle and release to fill. Right-click erases to void. Select a start or finish button and click to place; right-click or Esc returns to painting. A finish is optional: maps without one can still be saved and tested. Use \u2212 / + or the wheel to zoom.",

	"画笔样式": "Tool",
	"绘制项目": "Item",
	"框选": "Rectangle Fill",
	"出生点只支持单点放置": "Spawn points require single-cell placement",
	"画笔可连续绘制；框选拖出范围后松开填充，Esc 取消。右键擦除为 void。用 − / + 或滚轮缩放，放大后用滚动条查看地图。": "Paint continuously with the brush, or drag a rectangle and release to fill it. Esc cancels. Right-click erases to void. Use − / + or the wheel to zoom, and scrollbars to explore the map.",
	"缩小地图": "Zoom Out",
	"放大地图": "Zoom In",
	"左键拖动绘制，右键擦除为 void。用 − / + 或滚轮缩放，放大后用滚动条查看地图。": "Drag with the left button to paint and right-click to erase to void. Use − / + or the mouse wheel to zoom; use the scrollbars to explore the enlarged map.",
	"模块名后的点号需要指令名，例如 left.attack(180)。": "A dot after a module name must be followed by a command, for example left.attack(180).",
	"分波防守目标需要至少一名已注册的分波敌人。": "A wave-defense goal requires at least one registered wave enemy.",
	"用 for 循环扫描八个方向，发现靠近的敌人后持续射击，守住中心并消灭全部来敌。": "Scan eight directions with for, keep firing at approaching enemies, and hold the center until every wave is cleared.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块，敌人会依次从八个方向来袭。每次只出现一名敌人，击毁它的全部模块后，下一名敌人才会出现。\n\n守住中心，消灭所有来敌，即可完成关卡。": "This level allows up to 2 modules. Enemies arrive one by one from eight directions. Only one enemy appears at a time; destroy all of its modules before the next enemy arrives.\n\nHold the center and destroy every enemy to complete the level.",
	"建议先安装测距模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 sensor；在右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击模块，命名为 gun。\n\n测距负责发现敌人，射击负责击毁它。请按这个相邻布局开始练习，枪口与测距起点的偏移会影响瞄准。": "Place a rangefinder first to establish the assembly origin (0,0) and name it sensor. Place a shooting module to its right at (0.5,0) and name it gun.\n\nThe rangefinder detects enemies and the gun destroys them. Start with this adjacent layout: the offset between the muzzle and the sensor affects aiming.",
	"本关开放 for 有限循环：for (angle in 0..315 step 45) { ... }。\n\nangle 依次取 0、45、90、135、180、225、270、315，循环体共执行八次。区间包含两端；省略 step 时，步长默认为 1。": "This level unlocks finite for loops: for (angle in 0..315 step 45) { ... }.\n\nangle takes the values 0, 45, 90, 135, 180, 225, 270, and 315, running the body eight times. The range includes both endpoints. If step is omitted, it defaults to 1.",
	"把 sensor.distance(angle) 写在 for 里面，就能依次检测八个方向。0° 向右、90° 向上、180° 向左、270° 向下，斜向位于它们之间。\n\n敌人会让原本空旷方向的读数变短；可以判断距离是否小于 6 格来发现来敌。测距忽略自己的模块，不消耗逻辑时间。": "Put sensor.distance(angle) inside for to check eight directions in sequence. 0° points right, 90° up, 180° left, and 270° down; diagonal directions lie between them.\n\nAn enemy shortens the reading in an otherwise clear direction. Check for a distance below 6 cells to detect it. Ranging ignores your own modules and consumes no logic time.",
	"先用 variable aim = 0 保存射击方向。在扫描循环里，如果某个方向检测到敌人，就把 angle 赋给 aim。\n\nif 可以省略 else：没有检测到新目标时，保留之前的方向。angle 由 for 自动更新，在循环外不可使用，也不能手动改写。": "Start with variable aim = 0 to store a firing direction. During the scan, assign angle to aim when an enemy is detected.\n\nYou can omit else from if: keep the previous direction when no new target is found. for updates angle automatically; it cannot be used outside the loop or assigned manually.",
	"一次 for 扫描结束后，用 gun.shoot(aim) 向保存的方向射击。把扫描与射击一起放进 loop，就能持续警戒。\n\nshoot 会消耗一个逻辑 tick；冷却未结束时不会再次发射。敌人已被击毁而下一名尚未出现时，继续保持警戒，不能提前结束程序。": "After a for scan, use gun.shoot(aim) to fire in the stored direction. Put both scanning and shooting inside loop to keep watch.\n\nshoot consumes one logic tick. It does not fire again before its cooldown ends. Keep watching between enemies instead of ending the program early.",
	"敌人沿固定方向接近，靠近后会近战攻击。射击从枪口出发，子弹飞行需要时间；及时检测、持续射击，并确认敌人的所有模块都已被击毁。\n\n地图右上方会显示来袭波次、击毁进度和射击冷却。": "Enemies approach along fixed directions and use melee attacks when close. Shots start at the muzzle and bullets take time to travel. Detect enemies promptly, keep firing, and destroy every module on each enemy.\n\nThe upper-right corner of the map shows the incoming wave, defeat progress, and shooting cooldown.",
	"练习最多持续 90 秒。暂停冻结敌人、子弹和波次间隔；重置位置会恢复全部八波敌人，代码与装配会保留。\n\n之前开放的指令仍可使用，本关重点练习用 for 依次检查多个方向。": "The exercise lasts up to 90 seconds. Pause freezes enemies, bullets, and wave intervals. Reset restores all eight waves while keeping your code and assembly.\n\nPreviously unlocked instructions remain available. This level focuses on using for to check several directions in sequence.",
	"simultaneously 内只接受直接动作，不能包含 loop、for、if 或嵌套并行块。": "simultaneously only accepts direct actions, not loop, for, if, or nested parallel blocks.",
	"本关尚未解锁 for 有限循环。": "Finite for loops are not unlocked in this level.",
	"tick() 不能包含需要等待完成的 for 循环。": "tick() cannot contain for loops that wait for actions to finish.",
	"for 后需要括号，例如 for (angle in 0..315 step 45)。": "for requires parentheses, for example for (angle in 0..315 step 45).",
	"for 需要一个循环变量名称。": "for requires an iterator name.",
	"循环变量名称必须是非保留的英文标识符。": "An iterator name must be a non-reserved ASCII identifier.",
	"循环变量后需要 in 和区间。": "The iterator must be followed by in and a range.",
	"for 区间使用两个点 '..' 分隔起点与终点。": "Use two dots '..' between the start and end of a for range.",
	"for 区间后需要右括号 ')'。": "A for range must end with a closing parenthesis ')'.",
	"for 代码块不能为空；请至少添加一条语句。": "A for block cannot be empty; add at least one statement.",
	"if 与显式 else 代码块都不能为空；请添加至少一条语句。": "An if block and any explicit else block must each contain at least one statement.",
	"if 代码块不能为空，else 分支必须是有效代码块；省略 else 时允许空分支。": "The if block must not be empty and the else block must be valid; an omitted else may have an empty internal branch.",
	"for 的 step 步长不能为 0。": "The for step cannot be zero.",
	"for 的 step 方向必须朝向区间终点。": "The for step must move toward the end of the range.",
	"for 区间计算超出有限数值范围。": "The for range calculation exceeds finite numeric limits.",
	"for 每次进入最多允许 %d 次迭代。": "Each entry into a for loop allows at most %d iterations.",
	"for 步长过小或数值范围过大，无法可靠推进迭代。": "The for step is too small or its numeric range too large to advance reliably.",
	"tick() 和 simultaneously 块内不能包含 for 循环。": "tick() and simultaneously cannot contain for loops.",
	"循环变量名称必须是非保留的英文标识符，且不能与函数名相同。": "An iterator must use a non-reserved ASCII identifier that differs from every function name.",
	"模块名.ready() 查询射击冷却，不会开火。\n在 loop 中用 if / else 选择射击或后退。\nif 必须填写动作；else 可省略。Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "name.ready() checks shot cooldown without firing.\nUse if / else inside loop to choose firing or retreating.\nThe if body needs actions; else is optional. Ctrl+Enter runs.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块。10 波敌人会从任意方向依次来袭，击毁当前敌人的全部模块后，下一波才会出现。\n\n守住中心，消灭所有来敌。敌人的移动和近战模块都更坚固，需要持续命中。": "Use up to 2 modules. Ten waves arrive one at a time from random directions. Destroy every module of the current enemy before the next wave arrives.\n\nHold the center and defeat them all. Both their movement and melee modules are tougher and need repeated hits.",
	"建议先安装雷达模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 radar；在右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击模块，命名为 gun。\n\n本关按这一相邻布局练习雷达瞄准。射击从实际枪口出发，装配位置会影响命中。": "Place a radar named radar first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), with a shooting module named gun to its right at (0.5,0).\n\nThis level practices radar aiming with this adjacent layout. Shots originate at the actual gun, so placement affects accuracy.",
	"用 radar.scan() 探测最近的可见敌人，返回目标快照。没有敌人时，结果为 null。\n\n与固定八方向测距不同，雷达能发现任意角度的敌人。此前解锁的模块和指令仍可使用。": "radar.scan() finds the nearest visible enemy and returns a target snapshot, or null when none is visible.\n\nUnlike scanning eight fixed directions, radar detects enemies at any angle. Previously unlocked modules and commands remain available.",
	"可以用 variable target = radar.scan() 保存本次扫描。先判断 target != null，再读取 target.Angle()，把方向交给 gun.shoot(...)。\n\n目标快照不会跟随敌人更新，下一轮需要重新扫描。": "Store a scan with variable target = radar.scan(). Check target != null before reading target.Angle(), then pass that angle to gun.shoot(...).\n\nSnapshots do not track later movement. Scan again on the next iteration.",
	"先用 variable aim = 0 保存瞄准方向；发现目标时更新 aim，在条件判断之后调用 gun.shoot(aim)。把扫描和射击放入 loop 持续执行。\n\n下一波尚未出现时，也要执行射击动作让时间继续推进；只反复扫描的空转循环会被停止。": "Start with variable aim = 0. Update aim when a target is found, then call gun.shoot(aim) after the condition. Repeat scanning and firing in loop.\n\nKeep issuing shots between waves so time advances. A loop that only scans without any action will be stopped.",
	"射击有冷却，弹丸需要飞行时间且会逐渐减速。及时扫描、保持射击，不要在击毁一个模块后就停止。\n\n整台敌人被击毁后，残骸会在约 3 秒内淡出。淡出不影响下一波的出现与击毁计数。": "Shots have a cooldown; projectiles take time to travel and gradually slow down. Keep scanning and firing until every enemy module is destroyed.\n\nA defeated enemy fades out over about 3 seconds. Fading does not delay the next wave or change the defeat count.",
	"本关最多持续 180 秒。右上方的状态提示显示波次、击毁数量和射击冷却。\n\n暂停会冻结战斗与残骸淡出；重置位置会恢复全部 10 波并重新随机来袭角度，保留代码与装配。": "You have up to 180 seconds. The status pill shows the wave, defeats, and shooting cooldown.\n\nPause freezes combat and wreck fading. Reset restores all ten waves with new random angles while keeping your code and assembly.",
	"用 scan() 锁定目标，再将 Angle() 交给射击模块。": "Find a target with scan(), then pass Angle() to the shooting module.",
	"第十三关 · 十面埋伏": "Level 13 · Ambush from All Sides",
	"用雷达锁定任意方向的来敌，持续制导射击，守住中心并击毁全部 10 波敌人。": "Use radar to target enemies at any angle, keep firing, and hold the center through all 10 waves.",
	"建议先安装雷达模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 radar；在右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击模块，命名为 gun。": "Place a radar named radar first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), then a shooting module named gun to its right at (0.5,0).",
	"目标：守住中心，击毁全部 10 波随机方向的来敌。": "Goal: hold the center and destroy all 10 waves arriving from random directions.",
	"持续扫描，警戒任意方向": "Keep scanning for enemies from any direction",
	"雷达锁定 · 十面埋伏": "Radar targeting · Ambush from All Sides",
	"全部来袭波次已击毁，关卡完成！": "All enemy waves destroyed. Level complete!",
	"练习时间已结束。检查雷达扫描与射击，并在循环中持续警戒。": "Time is up. Check radar scanning and firing, and keep watching inside a loop.",
	"main() 已结束，仍有敌人来袭。请用 loop 持续扫描并射击。": "main() has ended, but more enemies are coming. Keep scanning and firing inside loop.",
	"用 scan() 扫描目标，判断 != null 后读取 Angle()。\n把角度交给 shoot，用 loop 持续扫描与射击。\n击毁全部 10 波来敌；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Use scan() to find a target; check != null before reading Angle().\nPass the angle to shoot; keep scanning and firing inside loop.\nDestroy all 10 waves. Ctrl+Enter runs.",
	"第十二关 · 八方来敌": "Level 12 · Enemies from Every Direction",
	"for 循环 · 八方警戒": "For Loops · Watch Every Direction",
	"目标：存活并击毁八个方向依次来袭的敌人。": "Goal: survive and destroy enemies arriving one by one from eight directions.",
	"for 按步长遍历角度，用一组指令检查不同方向。": "Use for to step through angles and check each direction with the same instructions.",
	"用 for 遍历八个方向，把角度交给 distance 和 shoot。\n先测距再射击，用 loop 持续警戒下一波来敌。\n迭代变量只在 for 块内有效；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Use for to visit eight directions and pass the angle to distance and shoot.\nMeasure before firing; keep watching for the next wave inside loop.\nThe iterator exists only inside its for block. Ctrl+Enter runs.",
	"已击毁 %d / %d 波敌人": "Waves cleared: %d / %d",
	"第 %d 波敌人来袭": "Wave %d incoming",
	"下一波将在 %.1f 秒后出现": "Next wave in %.1f s",
