	"八个方向的敌人已全部击毁，关卡完成！": "Enemies from all eight directions destroyed. Level complete!",
	"练习时间已结束。检查八个方向的扫描与射击，并在循环中持续警戒。": "Time is up. Check your scans and shots in all eight directions, and keep watch inside a loop.",
	"main() 已结束，仍有敌人来袭。请用 loop 持续扫描八个方向。": "main() has ended, but more enemies are coming. Use loop to keep scanning all eight directions.",
	"关卡 allow_for 必须是布尔值。": "Level allow_for must be a boolean.",
