	"randomInt 的上限 b 不能小于下限 a。": "randomInt upper bound b cannot be less than lower bound a.",
	"运行器的测试随机种子必须为整数。": "The runner test seed must be an integer.",

	"本关也开放随机函数：random() 返回 0 到 1 之间的数字；randomInt(a, b) 返回 a 到 b 之间的整数，包含两端，且 a、b 必须是整数、a 不大于 b。\n\n例如 shoot(randomInt(0, 359)) 可以向随机角度射击。每次执行调用都会重新取值；可以直接作为参数，也可以存入常量或变量。本关可自由选择是否使用随机函数。": "Random functions are also unlocked here: random() returns a number between 0 and 1; randomInt(a, b) returns an integer from a through b, including both bounds. Both a and b must be integers, with a no greater than b.\n\nFor example, shoot(randomInt(0, 359)) fires in a random direction. Each call draws a new value. Use it directly as an argument or store it in a constant or variable. Using random functions in this level is optional.",
	"雷达追击 · 制导射击": "Radar Pursuit · Guided Shooting",
	"本关是一次综合复习：最多安装 3 个模块，使用雷达、移动和射击模块追击敌人。\n\n敌人会随机改变方向和转向间隔，没有固定巡逻路线。它有较高的耐久，需要持续命中才能击毁。": "This review allows up to 3 modules: radar, movement and shooting. Track and pursue the enemy.\n\nIt changes direction at random intervals instead of following a patrol route. It has high durability and takes repeated hits to destroy.",
	"建议先安装雷达模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 eyes；右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击模块 gun；下方 (0,0.5) 安装移动模块 drive。\n\n三个模块必须沿边连接。先确认装配，再编写程序。": "Place radar eyes first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), shooting module gun to its right at (0.5,0), and movement module drive below at (0,0.5).\n\nAll three modules must share edges. Confirm the assembly before programming.",
	"eyes.scan() 返回最近可见敌人的扫描快照。先判断扫描结果 != null，再读取 Angle()、Distance 或 Position.x / Position.y。\n\nAngle() 是从雷达看向敌人的方向角，Distance 是两者的距离；每次扫描只记录当时的位置。": "eyes.scan() returns a snapshot of the nearest visible enemy. Check that the result != null before reading Angle(), Distance or Position.x / Position.y.\n\nAngle() points from the radar toward the enemy; Distance measures that separation. Each scan captures only the current position.",
	"把扫描、条件判断和动作放入 loop。敌人不断移动，需要经常重新扫描，并向新的方向追击。\n\n短距离移动能更快返回判断；追近后留出间隔，避免长距离追过头或走进地图外的 void。": "Repeat scanning, conditions and actions in a loop. Rescan often and follow the enemy’s changing direction.\n\nShort moves let you check again sooner. Leave a gap when close; long moves can overshoot or reach the void outside the arena.",
	"用 gun.ready() 判断是否能射击，用 gun.shoot(角度) 发射子弹。射击有冷却，敌人也会在子弹飞行期间继续移动。\n\n子弹会减速，离得太远容易落空或伤害不足；在冷却期间追近，再根据最新扫描开火。雷达和枪口位置不同，也会影响瞄准。": "Use gun.ready() to check the cooldown and gun.shoot(angle) to fire. The enemy keeps moving while each projectile travels.\n\nProjectiles slow down: distant shots can miss or deal less damage. Close the gap during cooldown, then aim using a fresh scan. Radar and muzzle offsets also affect aim.",
	"本关开放 value（也可写 constant）常量和 variable 变量，但使用与否由你决定。\n\n例如 value step = 0.3 可以保存固定步长；variable target = eyes.scan() 可以保存本次扫描。快照不会自动追踪敌人，需要再次赋值更新；常量声明后不能改写。": "value (also spelled constant) and variable are unlocked but optional.\n\nFor example, value step = 0.3 stores a fixed step, and variable target = eyes.scan() stores a scan. Snapshots do not track the enemy automatically: assign a new scan to update one. Constants cannot be reassigned.",
	"不使用常变量也能通关：先检查 eyes.scan() != null，再直接使用 eyes.scan().Angle() 和 eyes.scan().Distance。\n\n练习限时 120 秒，击毁敌人即完成。暂停冻结移动、射击和冷却；重置后敌人恢复耐久并重新随机游走，代码与装配会保留。": "You can also finish without bindings: check eyes.scan() != null, then use eyes.scan().Angle() and eyes.scan().Distance directly.\n\nDestroy the enemy within 120 seconds. Pause freezes movement, projectiles and cooldowns. Reset restores enemy health and starts a new random route while keeping your code and assembly.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块，目标是成功躲过敌人的 5 次近战攻击。\n\n敌人有移动、近战和雷达三个模块。本关继承第十关开放的玩家雷达、scan()、常量和变量，可以自由使用这些能力。": "This level allows up to 2 modules. Dodge 5 real enemy melee attacks.\n\nThe enemy has movement, melee and radar modules. You retain the player radar, scan(), constants and variables unlocked in Level 10.",
	"第十关 · 猎人游戏": "Level 10 · The Hunter Game",
	"用雷达反复扫描随机游走的敌人，边追击边射击；常量和变量可自由选用。": "Rescan, chase and shoot an enemy that wanders randomly. Constants and variables are optional.",
	"请先安装雷达作为装配原点 (0,0)，右侧 (0.5,0) 安装射击模块，下方 (0,0.5) 安装移动模块。": "Place radar first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), then shooting at (0.5,0) and movement at (0,0.5).",
	"反复扫描敌人，在射击冷却期间追近，再重新瞄准。": "Rescan the enemy, close in during cooldown, then aim again.",
	"scan() 探测目标；先判断 != null，再读取 Angle() 和 Distance。\n用 ready() 配合短距离移动与射击；常量、变量可选用。\n敌人随机游走，及时重新扫描；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "scan() finds a target; check != null before reading Angle() and Distance.\nCombine ready(), short moves and shots; bindings are optional.\nThe enemy wanders randomly, so rescan often. Ctrl+Enter runs.",
	"敌方耐久 %.1f": "Enemy health %.1f",
	"练习时间已结束。重新扫描敌人，缩短追击步长并靠近后射击。": "Time is up. Rescan the enemy, use shorter pursuit steps, and move closer before shooting.",

