	"Angle 需要空括号 '()'。": "Angle requires empty parentheses '()'.",
	"雷达目标仅支持 Angle()、Position、Distance 与坐标 x/y。": "Radar targets support only Angle(), Position, Distance, and x/y coordinates.",
	"本关尚未解锁 scan 雷达查询与目标属性。": "The scan radar query and target properties are not unlocked in this level.",
	"scan()：从本模块中心探测范围内最近的可见敌人，返回方向、位置和距离；没有目标时返回 null。雷达会被遮挡，读取结果不消耗逻辑 tick。": "scan(): Detects the nearest visible enemy from this module’s center and returns its direction, position, and distance, or null if none is found. Radar can be obstructed; reading takes no logical ticks.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块，目标是成功躲过敌人的 5 次近战攻击。\n\n敌人有移动、近战和雷达三个模块。本关已开放玩家雷达、scan()、常量和变量；第十关暂时跳过，也能直接使用这些能力。": "This level allows up to 2 modules. Your goal is to dodge 5 enemy melee attacks.\n\nThe enemy has movement, melee, and radar modules. Player radar, scan(), constants, and variables are already unlocked here, so you can use them while Level 10 is temporarily skipped.",
	"雷达可替代测距模块，与一个移动模块搭配。用 variable target = scan() 保存最近敌人的扫描结果；先用 if (target != null) 判断是否找到敌人，再读取 target.Angle()、target.Distance 或 target.Position。\n\nAngle() 是相对雷达的方向角，Distance 是距离；Position 是敌人的地图坐标，可用 Position.x 和 Position.y 读取。扫描结果是当时的快照，需要在循环中重新扫描才能更新。": "You can pair radar with a movement module in place of the rangefinder. Store the nearest enemy’s scan result with variable target = scan(). First check if (target != null), then read target.Angle(), target.Distance, or target.Position.\n\nAngle() gives the direction from the radar; Distance gives the distance. Position is the enemy’s map position; read Position.x and Position.y for coordinates. A scan result is a snapshot: scan again inside your loop to update it.",
	"关卡 allow_radar 必须是布尔值。": "Level allow_radar must be a boolean.",
	"本关尚未解锁 distance 测距查询。": "The distance query is not unlocked in this level.",
