	"撤销提示": "Undo Hint",
	"已撤销提示。": "Hint undone.",
	"连续失败次数必须为 0..1000000 的整数。": "Consecutive failures must be an integer from 0 to 1000000.",
	"提示记录保存失败：原通关记录格式无效，文件保持不变。": "Could not save hint usage: the existing completion record is invalid. The file was left unchanged.",
	"初始程序只提供 main() 和 function 框架，请自己填写函数、条件和动作。函数暂不接收参数，也不返回数值；本关同时开放 constant 常量与 variable 变量，可保存闪避距离和测距结果。\n\n练习最多持续 90 秒。暂停冻结敌人的扫描、接近和恢复；重置位置保留代码和装配，并重新从零记录闪避次数。": "The starter program provides only main() and function frames. Fill in the function, conditions, and actions. Functions currently take no arguments and return no values. This level also unlocks constant and variable bindings for storing dodge distances and range readings.\n\nThe exercise lasts at most 90 seconds. Pause freezes enemy scanning, approach, and recovery. Reset Position keeps your code and assembly and restarts the dodge count at zero.",
