	"本关需要两个沿水平方向共边的移动模块，才能在闸门落下前通过。": "Use two movement modules that share a horizontal edge to pass before the gate closes.",
	"请安装一个移动模块和一个近战模块；建议先安装移动模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，近战在右侧 (0.5,0)。": "Install one movement module and one melee module. Place movement first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), then melee to its right at (0.5,0).",
