	"tick() 和 simultaneously 块内只接受有限动作，不能调用用户函数。": "tick() and simultaneously blocks only accept finite actions, not user function calls.",
	"第十一关 · 巧能躲避": "Level 11 · Evasive Maneuvers",
	"用函数封装测距与闪避，在雷达敌人锁定后及时离开攻击横线，连续躲过五次攻击。": "Encapsulate range checks and evasive movement in a function. Leave the attack line after the radar enemy locks on, and dodge five attacks in a row.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块，目标是成功躲过敌人的 5 次近战攻击。\n\n敌人有移动、近战和雷达三个模块。雷达负责锁定位置，但本关还不开放玩家的雷达模块和 scan() 指令。": "This level allows up to 2 modules. Your goal is to dodge 5 enemy melee attacks.\n\nThe enemy has movement, melee, and radar modules. Its radar locks onto your position; the player radar module and scan() command will be introduced in a later lesson.",
	"建议先安装测距模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 sensor，在右侧偏移 (0.5,0) 安装移动模块并命名为 drive。\n\n测距用来观察右侧敌人是否靠近，移动用来离开它即将攻击的横线。": "Place a rangefinder first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), named sensor, and a movement module to its right at offset (0.5,0), named drive.\n\nUse the rangefinder to observe the enemy approaching from the right, and movement to leave the horizontal line it is about to attack.",
	"敌人每次扫描只锁定你当时的位置：先绕到这个位置的右侧准备，再向左接近到前方一格，随后立即向左攻击。\n\n它不会在这次接近过程中重新瞄准。出手后短暂恢复，再扫描你的新位置。": "Each scan locks onto your position at that moment. The enemy first moves to the right of that position, then approaches leftward to one tile ahead and immediately attacks left.\n\nIt does not update its aim during this approach. After attacking, it briefly recovers, then scans your new position.",
	"function 可以把一组动作封装成有名字的函数，例如 function dodge() { ... }。在 main() 内写 dodge()，就会执行这个函数的内容。\n\n函数写在 main() 外面；调用完成后，程序会回到调用处继续执行。函数名称由你自己选择。": "function packages a group of actions under a name, such as function dodge() { ... }. Write dodge() inside main() to execute that function.\n\nDefine functions outside main(). Once the call finishes, execution resumes after the call. Choose your own function names.",
	"把测距判断和闪避动作放在函数里，再在 main() 的 loop 中反复调用它。\n\n当右侧敌人足够靠近时，向上或向下移出攻击横线；敌人还远时，继续观察。注意测距读数从模块中心开始，移动要留足时间。": "Put range checks and evasive movement in a function, then call it repeatedly from a loop inside main().\n\nWhen the enemy on the right is close enough, move up or down out of its attack line. Keep observing while it is far away. Range readings start at the module center, and movement needs time.",
	"每次实际攻击落空才会计入一次成功闪避。只要这名敌人的近战命中你的任何模块，本次练习就会失败。\n\n观察右上方的敌人状态与闪避次数；摧毁敌人或让它停止出手都不能代替躲过 5 次攻击。": "Only an actual attack that misses counts as a successful dodge. If this enemy’s melee attack hits any of your modules, the run fails.\n\nWatch the enemy status and dodge count in the upper right. Destroying the enemy or preventing it from attacking cannot replace dodging 5 attacks.",
	"初始程序只提供 main() 和 function 框架，请自己填写函数、条件和动作。函数暂不接收参数，也不返回数值；本关不需要变量。\n\n练习最多持续 90 秒。暂停冻结敌人的扫描、接近和恢复；重置位置保留代码和装配，并重新从零记录闪避次数。": "The starter program provides only main() and function frames. Fill in the function, conditions, and actions. Functions currently take no arguments and return no values; variables are not needed.\n\nThe exercise lasts at most 90 seconds. Pause freezes enemy scanning, approach, and recovery. Reset Position keeps your code and assembly and restarts the dodge count at zero.",
	"目标：存活并连续躲过敌人的全部突袭。": "Goal: survive and dodge every enemy ambush.",
	"自定义函数 · 巧能躲避": "Custom Functions · Evasive Maneuvers",
	"把检测与闪避写进 function，再从 main() 调用。": "Put detection and evasion in a function, then call it from main().",
	"function 定义一组可重复调用的指令。\n用 distance 检测敌人接近，再用 if 选择闪避方向。\n函数写在 main() 外；用 loop 重复调用。Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "function defines a reusable group of commands.\nUse distance to detect an approach and if to choose an evasive direction.\nDefine functions outside main(); call them repeatedly with loop. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
