	"测距模块": "Rangefinder Module",
	"distance(角度)：从本模块中心沿指定方向测量到首个墙壁、障碍物或其他机器部件表面的距离。忽略自身机器，不消耗逻辑 tick；测量值不是整台机器可以安全移动的距离。": "distance(angle): Measures from this module's center to the first wall, obstacle, or other machine module in that direction. Ignores your own machine and takes no logical ticks; the reading is not the entire machine's safe travel distance.",

	# 第九关蜿蜒穿行：JSON 教程本土化。
	"测距导航 · 长蛇隧道": "Rangefinding · Serpentine Tunnel",
	"用测距模块读取前方空隙，留出机器占地，再交替向左右和上方穿过长蛇隧道。": "Read the space ahead with a rangefinder, leave room for the robot, and alternate sideways and upward through the winding tunnel.",
	"本关最多安装 2 个模块，新增测距模块。它能沿指定方向测量前方障碍的距离，但本身不能移动。\n\n搭配一个移动模块，让程序读取通道长度，自动走过这条长蛇形隧道。": "This level allows up to 2 modules and introduces the rangefinder. It measures the distance to an obstacle in a chosen direction, but cannot move by itself.\n\nPair it with a movement module so your program can read the passage length and navigate the long serpentine tunnel.",
	"建议先放置测距模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 sensor；再在下方偏移 (0,0.5) 放移动模块，命名为 drive。\n\n两个半格模块沿边连接，测距模块位于机器的前上方。这个布局适合本关向右、向上、向左的路线。": "Place a rangefinder first to establish the assembly origin (0,0), named sensor, then a movement module below it at offset (0,0.5), named drive.\n\nThe two half-tile modules share an edge, with the sensor at the top of the robot. This layout suits this level’s right, up, and left movements.",
	"distance(角度) 返回测距模块中心到前方第一个障碍表面的距离。角度仍是 0° 向右、90° 向上、180° 向左、270° 向下。\n\n墙壁、void 和地图边界都会被检测到；本机模块不会挡住自己的测量。读取不会移动机器，也不消耗逻辑时间。": "distance(angle) returns the distance from the rangefinder’s center to the first obstacle surface ahead. Angles are still 0° right, 90° up, 180° left, and 270° down.\n\nWalls, void, and map boundaries are detected; the robot’s own modules do not obstruct its measurement. Reading does not move the robot or consume logic time.",
	"测到的距离不是整台机器可以直接移动的距离。模块有宽度，走满读数会撞上墙。\n\n采用前面的装配时，向右可以写 move(0, distance(0) - 0.5)，在障碍前留下半格余量；向上和向左也要按各自方向重新测量。": "A measured distance is not the distance the whole robot can safely travel. Modules have width, so moving the full reading would hit the wall.\n\nWith the suggested assembly, move(0, distance(0) - 0.5) leaves half a tile before the obstacle on the right. Measure again in the corresponding direction before moving up or left.",
	"观察通道的重复规律：先向右，再向上；接着向左，再向上。把这一组方向放进 loop，每次执行移动时重新读取对应方向的距离。\n\n不用记住每段有多少格，也不用复制整条路线。到达绿色终点后，游戏会自动停止循环。": "Look for the repeating pattern: right, then up; left, then up. Put this group of directions in a loop, reading the matching direction again for each move.\n\nYou do not need to memorize each passage length or copy the entire route. The game stops the loop automatically when the robot reaches the green finish.",
	"也可以用 sensor.distance(角度) 明确指定测距模块。读数可加减一个余量，或用于 if 中的数值比较，例如 distance(90) > 0.5。\n\n查询要放在数值参数或条件里，不能单独写成动作；本关不需要变量。": "You can also use sensor.distance(angle) to select a named rangefinder. Add or subtract a clearance from the reading, or use it in an if comparison such as distance(90) > 0.5.\n\nA query belongs in a numeric argument or condition, not as a standalone action. Variables are not needed in this level.",
	"初始程序只有 main() 框架，请自己填写测距和循环。读数会随着机器位置实时变化，装配位置改变时也要重新考虑余量。\n\n暂停冻结当前动作；重置位置或重新运行会回到起点，保留你的代码与装配。": "The initial program contains only a main() skeleton. Fill in the rangefinding and loop yourself. Readings change with the robot’s position, and a different assembly may need a different clearance.\n\nPausing freezes the current action. Resetting or rerunning returns to the start while preserving your code and assembly.",
	"distance(角度) 读取前方距离；为真实模块占地留下余量。": "distance(angle) reads the space ahead; leave clearance for the modules’ actual footprint.",
	"测距从传感器中心开始；推荐中心测距、下方移动，向右、上、左各留 0.5 格。": "Measurements start at the sensor center. Put the sensor at the center and the drive below; leave 0.5 tiles when moving right, up, or left.",
	"在 loop 中交替向左右和上方移动，每段都重新测量；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Alternate sideways and upward moves in a loop, measuring each passage again. Ctrl+Enter runs the program.",
	"第九关 · 蜿蜒穿行": "Level 9 · Winding Passage",

