	# 第八关同时执行与联动警报教程；示例名称和源代码保持原文。
	"警报已触发：请先解除警报，再移动。": "Alarm triggered: disable both alarms before moving.",
	"警报已触发：两侧警报器未同时摧毁。": "Alarm triggered: destroy both alarms together.",
	"同时执行 · 左右为“铃”": "Simultaneous Actions · Paired Alarms",
	"simultaneously { ... } 同一帧启动块内动作。\n使用不同的模块名分别控制左右攻击，全部完成后再移动。\n警报解除前移动或先后拆除都会报警；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "simultaneously { ... } starts its actions in the same tick.\nUse different module names for the left and right attacks; move after both finish.\nMoving too soon or disabling the alarms one after another triggers them. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"同步启动多个动作，全部完成后继续执行。": "Start multiple actions together, then continue once all have finished.",
	"本关目标：同时解除左右两个警报器，再向上逃出监狱。": "Goal: disable both alarms at the same time, then escape upward.",
	"警报器 {alive} / {total}": "Alarms {alive} / {total}",
	"警报已解除，出口已打开": "Alarms disabled · Exit open",
	"同时破坏两个警报器后，再向上逃出监狱。": "Destroy both alarms at the same time, then escape upward.",
	"出口已解锁，请继续向上走到终点。": "Exit unlocked. Continue upward to the goal.",
	"第八关 · 左右为“铃”": "Level 8 · Bells on Both Sides",
	"用 simultaneously 同时解除左右警报器，再向上逃离；解除前不能移动。": "Use simultaneously to disable both alarms, then escape upward. Do not move before they are disabled.",
	"本关最多安装 3 个模块。两个警报器分别在出生点左侧 2 格、右侧 3 格。\n\n它们互相监视：只摧毁其中一个，另一个就会触发警报；全部解除前，移动机器也会立即失败。": "Install up to 3 modules. The alarms are 2 tiles left and 3 tiles right of your starting point.\n\nThey monitor each other: destroying only one triggers the other. Moving before both are disabled also fails the run immediately.",
	"装配原点不一定要放移动模块。建议先放置近战模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 left；再向右共边放移动模块 drive，偏移 (0.5,0)；最右侧放近战模块 right，偏移 (1,0)。\n\n每个模块宽半格，三个模块沿边连接。": "The assembly origin does not have to be a drive. Place a melee module first to establish (0,0) and name it left; attach a movement module named drive at (0.5,0), then a melee module named right at (1,0).\n\nEach module is half a tile wide. All three share edges.",
	"近战射程从出手模块的实际中心计算，为 2 格。上面的装配让两个近战模块都够得到各自的警报器。\n\n不要先移动来接近目标；通过组装位置解决左右距离不同的问题。": "Melee reach is 2 tiles from the attacking module's actual center. This assembly puts both alarms within reach of their respective melee modules.\n\nDo not move closer first. Use the assembly layout to account for the different distances.",
	"新指令 simultaneously { ... } 会同时启动块内的动作。把两个具名攻击分别写在块内，每行一个，让 left 向左、right 向右出手。\n\n两个警报器必须在同一个逻辑 tick 内被摧毁。顺序写在 main() 中，会先完成第一击，来不及等待第二击。": "The new simultaneously { ... } block starts its actions together. Put the two named attacks inside, one per line: left attacks left and right attacks right.\n\nBoth alarms must be destroyed in the same logic tick. Writing the attacks sequentially in main() finishes the first strike before the second can start.",
	"同时执行块内至少写两条 move、attack 或 shoot 动作，可用模块名指定实例。每个模块一次只能承担一个动作；整台机器同时最多执行一次移动。\n\n块内不再嵌套 loop、if 或 simultaneously，也不能把同时执行块写在 tick() 中。": "A simultaneous block needs at least two move, attack, or shoot actions. Use module names to select instances. A module can handle only one action at a time, and the robot can perform at most one move at once.\n\nDo not nest loop, if, or simultaneously inside the block, or place a simultaneous block in tick().",
	"同时执行块会等待其中全部动作完成，才继续后面的代码。两个警报器解除后，上方安全门自动打开。\n\n随后向上移动 6 格，让机器中心到达绿色终点，才算完成越狱。": "The simultaneous block waits for all its actions to finish before continuing with the following code. Disabling both alarms opens the security gate above.\n\nThen move 6 tiles up to bring the machine center to the green goal and complete the escape.",
	"本关初始代码只有 main() 框架，请自己填写同时攻击和脱离路线。\n\n暂停会冻结全部动作；重置位置或重新运行会恢复警报器与安全门，保留你的代码和装配。": "The starter code contains only a main() frame. Fill in the simultaneous attacks and escape route yourself.\n\nPause freezes every action. Reset Position or a new run restores both alarms and the gate while keeping your code and assembly.",

	# 第七关条件判断教程；不翻译玩家代码或模块实例名。
	"第七关 · 射击与躲避": "Level 7 · Fighting Retreat",
	"用 if / else 判断射击冷却，边退边射，击败持续逼近的敌人。": "Use if / else to check shot cooldowns. Fire and retreat to defeat the advancing enemy.",
	"条件判断 · 射击与躲避": "Conditions · Fighting Retreat",
	"if / else 根据射击是否就绪，选择不同动作。": "if / else chooses an action based on whether your shot is ready.",
	"模块名.ready() 查询射击冷却，不会开火。\n在 loop 中用 if / else 选择射击或后退。\n两个分支都要填写动作；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "name.ready() checks shot cooldown without firing.\nUse if / else inside loop to choose firing or retreating.\nFill in both branches. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"射击模块可命名为 gun；用 gun.ready() 查询冷却。修改后点击应用。": "Name your shooting module gun and check it with gun.ready(). Apply after renaming.",
	"关卡 allow_conditionals 必须是布尔值。": "Level allow_conditionals must be a boolean.",
	"本关最多安装两个模块。\n建议先安装移动模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，再沿水平方向共边安装射击模块，命名为 gun。\n\n通道只有一格宽，请留意整台机器的占地。": "Install up to 2 modules. Place a drive first to establish the assembly origin (0,0) and a shooting module against a horizontal edge; name it gun. The corridor is only one tile wide, so check the footprint of your entire machine.",
	"敌人从出生点右侧六格处持续向左推进，并不断向左近战攻击。\n\n前方近战模块有更高耐久。保持存活并击毁全部敌方模块；只站着射击容易被追上。": "The enemy starts 6 tiles right of spawn. It keeps moving and attacking left. Its front melee module has extra health. Survive and destroy every enemy module; standing still lets it catch you.",
	"gun.ready() 查询指定射击模块是否冷却完毕，返回真或假。\n查询不会发射子弹，也不消耗时间。\n\n这里的 gun 必须与装配中射击模块的名称完全一致。": "gun.ready() checks whether the shooting module named gun has cooled down. It returns true or false without firing or consuming time. The name must exactly match your assembly.",
	"用 if (gun.ready()) { ... } else { ... } 作出选择：条件为真时执行 if 的分支，否则执行 else 的分支。两个分支都需要你填写动作，运行时只执行其中一个。": "Use if (gun.ready()) { ... } else { ... } to choose: a true condition runs the if branch; otherwise, the else branch runs. Write actions in both branches. Only one branch runs each time.",
	"在 loop 中反复进行条件判断：可以开火时射击，冷却期间后退。\n\n观察地图和角度图例，自己决定方向与每次后退的距离。": "Place the condition inside loop to keep checking: fire when ready and retreat while cooling down. Use the map and angle legend to choose your directions and retreat distance.",
	"每次移动完成后，才会进行下一次条件判断。\n较短的后退步长能更及时地重新检查冷却。\n\n也要观察身后剩余的道路，灰色区域不能通过。": "A move must finish before the next condition check. Shorter retreats let you check cooldowns more promptly. Watch the road behind you: gray void cannot be crossed.",
	"练习最多持续三十秒。暂停会冻结移动、冷却和子弹；重新运行会恢复双方状态。\n\n初始代码只提供循环框架，请自己完成条件和动作。": "The practice lasts up to 30 seconds. Pause freezes movement, cooldowns and bullets. A new run restores both machines. The starter only provides a loop; write the condition and actions yourself.",

	"重置代码": "Reset Code",
	"代码已恢复为本关初始程序。": "Code restored to this level's starter program.",
	"恢复当前关卡的初始程序，保留装配与通关记录。": "Restore this level's starter program, keeping assembly and progress.",
	"名称用于代码调用，例如 drive.move(0, 3)。修改后点击应用。": "Use this name in code, e.g. drive.move(0, 3). Apply after renaming.",
	# 第六关循环教程与提示。
	"第六关 · 循环阶梯": "Level 6 · Loop Staircase",
	"观察阶梯的重复规律，自己编写 loop 中的动作，到达终点。": "Find the repeating pattern in the staircase and write the actions inside loop to reach the goal.",
	"循环编程 · 十组阶梯": "Loops · Ten Steps",
	"loop { ... } 按顺序重复块内指令，直到关卡结束。": "loop { ... } repeats its commands in order until the level ends.",
	"观察一组台阶，把重复的动作写进 loop。\n花括号内一行一条指令，填写后再运行。\n暂停保留循环进度；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "Study one step and write the repeated actions inside loop.\nUse one command per line; fill in the block before running.\nPause keeps your loop progress. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"关卡 allow_loops 必须是布尔值。": "Level allow_loops must be a boolean.",
	"本关最多安装 1 个模块。选择移动模块，在图纸任意网格位置放置，落点记为 (0,0)。确认装配后开始编程。": "Install only 1 module: choose a movement module and place it anywhere on the blueprint grid. Its placement becomes (0,0). Confirm your assembly to start coding.",
	"这条路线由重复的台阶组成。观察一组台阶的转弯位置和每段路的长度，想一想哪些动作可以反复使用。": "The route repeats the same step. Look at where one step turns and how long each segment is. Which actions could you repeat?",
	"把重复执行的指令放进 loop { ... }。loop 后直接写花括号，不加小括号；块内按从上到下的顺序执行，每次移动完成后才开始下一条。": "Put the commands you want to repeat inside loop { ... }. Use braces directly after loop, with no parentheses. Commands run from top to bottom, each move finishing before the next begins.",
	"程序区只保留了空的 loop 框架。请自己在花括号内写出走完一组台阶的动作，每行一条指令。填写后再运行，观察机器人是否沿着下一组台阶继续前进。": "The editor provides an empty loop. Write the actions for one step inside the braces, one command per line. Fill it in before running, then watch whether the robot follows the next step.",
	"loop 会持续重复，并不是固定循环十次。机器人走完十组台阶到达绿色终点时，关卡会结束运行；不需要额外写停止指令。步长不对碰到灰色区域时会失败，并标出出错行。": "loop repeats continuously; it does not count ten rounds. Once your robot climbs all ten steps and reaches the green goal, the level stops the run. No stop command is needed. A wrong distance can hit gray void and highlight the failing line.",
	"暂停会保留当前移动和循环进度，继续后接着走。停止或重置位置保留代码与装配，重新运行从起点开始。本阶段循环写在 main() 中，tick() 内不允许循环。": "Pause keeps the current move and loop progress; Resume continues from there. Stop or Reset Position keeps your code and assembly, and a new run starts at spawn. For now, loops belong in main(); tick() cannot contain loops.",

	"警报已触发，守卫仍然存活，机器人被处决。请先摧毁守卫，再处理警报。": "The alarm triggered while the guard was alive. Your machine was executed. Defeat the guard before destroying the alarm.",
	# 第五关命名调用、警报与越狱状态。
	"引导": "Guide",
	"第五关 · 越狱行动": "Level 5 · Prison Escape",
	"给模块命名，先解除左侧警卫，再拆除右侧警报器，向上逃离监狱。": "Name your modules. Defeat the guard on the left, disable the alarm on the right, and escape upward.",
	"命名模块 · 越狱行动": "Named Modules · Prison Escape",
	"目标：先解除警卫，再破坏警报器，最后向上离开。": "Goal: defeat the guard, destroy the alarm, then escape upward.",
	"模块名.attack(角度) · 只调用该模块\n直接 attack 会调用所有近战模块。\n命名同样支持 move 和 shoot；Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "name.attack(angle) · Calls only that module\nattack without a name calls all melee modules.\nNamed calls also support move and shoot. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"名称用于代码调用，例如 left.attack(180)。修改后点击应用。": "Use this name in code, e.g. left.attack(180). Apply after renaming.",
	"已安全离开监狱，关卡完成！": "You escaped safely. Level complete!",
	"出口已解锁，请继续向上到达绿色终点。": "Exit unlocked. Continue upward to the green goal.",
	"越狱尚未完成。先解除警卫，再破坏警报器，最后向上离开。": "Escape incomplete. Defeat the guard, destroy the alarm, then move up to the exit.",
	"警卫已解除": "Guard defeated",
	"左侧警卫存活": "Left guard alive",
	"警报已触发": "Alarm triggered",
	"警报器已拆除": "Alarm disabled",
	"右侧警报器待拆除": "Right alarm intact",
	"出口已解锁 · 向上离开": "Exit unlocked · Escape upward",
	"出口锁定": "Exit locked",
	"objects 支持限时闸门、障碍物、监狱警报与安全门；enemies 支持接近攻击与警卫。player_spawn 可设为 null。\n模块使用 module_id 和 offset；extra 保存未知的顶层字段。": "objects supports timed gates, obstacles, prison alarms and security gates; enemies supports approaching attackers and guards. player_spawn may be null.\nModules use module_id and offset; extra preserves unknown root fields.",
	"本关最多安装 3 个模块。警卫在出生点左侧 2 格，警报器在右侧 2 格。先击毁警卫，再拆除警报器，最后向上逃出监狱。": "Install up to 3 modules. The guard is 2 tiles left of spawn; the alarm is 2 tiles right. Defeat the guard first, disable the alarm, then escape upward.",
	"建议先安装移动模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，命名为 drive；左右各共边安装一个近战模块，分别命名为 left 和 right，偏移为 (-0.5, 0) 与 (0.5, 0)。选择模块后，在名称栏修改并应用。": "Place a drive first to establish the assembly origin (0,0) and name it drive. Place melee modules against its left and right edges, at (-0.5, 0) and (0.5, 0), named left and right. Select each module, edit its Name, then apply.",
	"直接调用 attack(角度)，会同时调用所有可用的近战模块，各自从自己的位置攻击。给模块命名后，left.attack(180) 只调用 left，right 不会随之攻击或进入冷却。": "attack(angle) calls all available melee modules, each attacking from its own position. left.attack(180) calls only left; right does not attack or enter cooldown.",
	"先让左侧模块向 180° 攻击警卫，再让右侧模块向 0° 攻击警报器。如果先拆掉警报器而警卫仍存活，警卫会立即处决整台机器，本次运行失败。": "Use the left module to attack the guard at 180 degrees, then the right module to attack the alarm at 0 degrees. Destroying the alarm while the guard is alive immediately destroys your entire machine and fails the run.",
	"警卫和警报器都被击毁后，上方出口门自动打开。使用 move(90, 5) 向上移动 5 格到绿色终点。仅拆除两个目标还不算逃脱。": "Once both targets are destroyed, the exit gates open. Use move(90, 5) to move 5 tiles up to the green goal. Destroying the targets alone does not finish the escape.",
	"代码中的模块名区分大小写，请使用字母或下划线开头的名称。拼错名称或调用该模块不具备的能力，会显示错误位置；失败后仍保留代码和装配。": "Module names in code are case-sensitive. Start names with a letter or underscore. A misspelled name or unsupported ability shows the error location. Failed runs keep your code and assembly.",
	"命名调用也适用于 move 和 shoot；不带模块名时仍会调用所有同类模块。main() 按顺序执行；tick() 仍可持续调用短动作。如果同一 tick 内同时击毁警卫与警报器，也可安全逃脱。": "Named calls also support move and shoot. Calls without a name still use all modules of that type. main() runs sequentially; tick() can repeat short actions. Destroying both targets in the same tick is also safe.",

	"练习时间已结束，尚未完成目标。调整程序后再试一次。": "Time is up; the goal is not complete. Adjust your program and try again.",
	"射击就绪": "Ready to fire",
	"射击冷却 %.1f 秒": "Shot cooldown %.1f s",
	"机器的全部模块已被摧毁，本次运行失败。": "All your modules were destroyed. Run failed.",
	"shoot 需要安装可用的射击模块。": "shoot requires an available shooting module.",
	"shoot(角度)：发射逐渐减速的弹丸；命中伤害与速度成正比。冷却 10 tick，冷却中调用无效果。": "shoot(angle): fire a decelerating bullet. Impact damage scales with speed. Cooldown: 10 ticks; calls during cooldown do nothing.",
	# 第四关射击、持续回调与敌方模块状态。
	"第四关 · 远程打击": "Level 4 · Sustained Fire",
	"射击模块": "Shooting Module",
	"安装一个射击模块，在 tick() 中持续射击，击毁从右侧接近的双模块敌人。": "Install one shooting module. Fire from tick() to destroy both modules of the approaching enemy.",
	"目标：存活并击毁敌人的所有模块。": "Goal: survive and destroy every enemy module.",
	"main() 执行一次；tick() 每 0.1 秒调用一次。": "main() runs once; tick() runs every 0.1 seconds.",
	"shoot(角度) · 0° 向右\n子弹减速，命中伤害随速度降低；冷却中调用无效果。\n把 shoot(0) 写在 tick() 中持续射击。Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "shoot(angle) · 0° points right\nBullets slow down and deal less damage. Calls during cooldown do nothing.\nPut shoot(0) in tick() for sustained fire. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"shoot(角度) · 0° 向右\n子弹减速，命中伤害随速度降低；冷却中调用无效果。": "shoot(angle) · 0° points right\nBullets slow down and deal less damage. Calls during cooldown do nothing.",
	"敌方模块 %d / %d": "Enemy modules %d / %d",
	"练习剩余 %.1f 秒": "Practice time left %.1f s",
	"射击模块 · 持续射击": "Shooting Module · Sustained fire",
	"敌人所有模块已击毁，关卡完成！": "All enemy modules destroyed. Level complete!",
	"main() 已结束，敌人仍在行动。持续射击请使用 tick()。": "main() has finished; the enemy is still active. Use tick() for sustained fire.",
	"练习时间已结束，敌人仍有模块存活。试着在 tick() 中持续向右 shoot(0)。": "Time is up; enemy modules remain. Try shoot(0) inside tick() for sustained fire.",
	"本关只能安装一个模块。选择新解锁的射击模块，在图纸任意网格位置放置，落点记为 (0,0)。敌人在你右侧 6 格处，由前方移动模块和后方近战模块组成。": "Install only one module: choose the new shooting module and place it anywhere on the blueprint grid. Its placement becomes (0,0). The enemy starts 6 tiles right, with a front drive and a rear melee module.",
	"shoot(角度) 会发射子弹，0° 向右。子弹飞行中逐渐减速，速度越快，命中伤害越高；速度降到零时消失。每颗子弹只命中最先碰到的目标。": "shoot(angle) fires a bullet; 0° points right. Bullets slow down in flight. Faster hits deal more damage; bullets disappear at zero speed. Each bullet hits only its first target.",
	"main() 只执行一次。把 shoot(0) 写进 tick()，它就会每个逻辑 tick 调用一次，实现持续射击。保留一个空的 main() 入口。": "main() runs once. Put shoot(0) inside tick() to call it every simulation tick for sustained fire. Keep an empty main() entry point.",
	"射击模块有冷却时间。冷却中的 shoot 调用不会发射，也不会报错；不需要手动等待，继续在 tick() 中调用即可。暂停也会冻结冷却与子弹。": "The shooting module has a cooldown. Calls during cooldown do nothing and do not fail. Keep calling shoot from tick(); no manual wait is needed. Pause freezes cooldowns and bullets.",
	"敌人会向左移动 4.5 格，然后向左近战攻击。近战一次只命中一个模块，打掉前方移动模块并不等于击毁整台敌人；用持续射击摧毁两个模块。": "The enemy moves 4.5 tiles left, then attacks left. Each melee strike hits one module. Destroying the front drive does not defeat the entire machine; keep shooting to destroy both modules.",
	"你只要存活并击毁敌人的所有模块即可通关。为避免僵持，练习在 15 秒后结束；失败后保留代码和装配，重新运行会恢复双方和全部冷却。": "Survive and destroy every enemy module to win. Practice ends after 15 seconds to avoid a stalemate. Retry keeps your code and assembly, and restores both machines and all cooldowns.",
	# 内置教程翻译；不会修改作者地图文件或玩家代码。
	"第二关 · 限时闸门": "Level 2 · Timed Gate",
	"第三关 · 初出茅庐": "Level 3 · First Strike",
	"近战模块": "Melee Module",
	"只向右前进 8 格。在 3.5 秒后落下的闸门前，用两个移动模块叠加速度抢先通过。": "Move 8 tiles right. Combine two movement modules to pass the gate before it closes at 3.5 seconds.",
	"解锁近战模块与 attack(角度)。靠近右侧 5 格处的障碍物，在 2 格射程内将它摧毁。": "Unlock melee and attack(angle). Approach the obstacle 5 tiles right, then destroy it within the 2-tile range.",
	"目标：用近战模块摧毁紫色障碍物。": "Goal: destroy the purple obstacle with a melee module.",
	"程序从 main() 开始，依次执行每条指令。": "Execution starts at main(), with one command at a time.",
	"move(角度, 距离) · attack(角度)\n近战射程 2 格，从近战模块中心计算。\n一行一条指令，支持 // 注释。Ctrl+Enter 运行。": "move(angle, distance) · attack(angle)\nMelee reaches 2 tiles from the module center.\nOne call per line; // comments. Ctrl+Enter to run.",
	"闸门已落下": "Gate closed",
	"闸门将在 %.1f 秒后落下": "Gate closes in %.1f s",
	"障碍物已摧毁": "Obstacle destroyed",
	"近战射程 2 格 · 障碍物耐久 %.0f": "Range 2 tiles · Obstacle health %.0f",
	"障碍物已摧毁，关卡完成！": "Obstacle destroyed. Level complete!",
	"程序已执行完，但障碍物尚未摧毁。请靠近目标并检查攻击方向。": "Program finished, but the obstacle remains. Move closer and check the attack direction.",
	"闸门已落下并碰到机器，本次运行失败。": "The closing gate hit the machine. Run failed.",
	"移动与近战 · 摧毁障碍": "Move & strike · Destroy the obstacle",
	"attack(角度)：从本模块中心沿指定方向攻击 2 格内的第一个障碍物。每次攻击消耗一个逻辑 tick。": "attack(angle): strike the first obstacle within 2 tiles of this module. Each strike takes one simulation tick.",
	"这一关是一格宽的水平直路，没有上下转弯。终点在出生点右侧 8 格。": "This one-tile-wide corridor is a straight horizontal path. The goal is 8 tiles right of spawn.",
	"闸门在运行后的第 35 tick（3.5 秒）落下。一个移动模块速度不够；两个移动模块叠加为 2 格/秒，可以在落下前完全通过。": "The gate closes at tick 35 (3.5 seconds). One drive is too slow; two combine to 2 tiles/s and can clear it in time.",
	"先安装移动模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，再向右共边安装第二个，偏移为 (0.5, 0)。编写 move(0, 8)，全程只向右移动。": "Place the first movement module to establish the assembly origin (0,0) and a second against its right edge, at offset (0.5, 0). Write move(0, 8) to travel straight right.",
	"倒计时从运行程序开始；暂停冻结倒计时，停止或重新运行会重新打开闸门。落下时被闸门碰到也会失败。": "The countdown starts when you run. Pause freezes it; stop or rerun opens the gate again. Being caught by the closing gate also fails the run.",
	"本关最多安装两个模块。建议先安装一个移动模块作为装配原点 (0,0)，在右侧偏移 (0.5, 0) 安装一个近战模块。每个模块占 0.5 × 0.5 格。": "Install up to two modules: a drive first to establish the assembly origin (0,0) and a melee module to its right at (0.5, 0). Each occupies 0.5 × 0.5 tiles.",
	"障碍物中心在出生点右侧 5 格。近战只能攻击距离本模块中心 2 格内的目标；方向与 move 相同，0° 向右。": "The obstacle center is 5 tiles right of spawn. Melee reaches 2 tiles from its own module center. Angles match move: 0° points right.",
	"试着先 move(0, 3)，再另起一行写 attack(0)。移动完成后才攻击，靠近后不要直接撞进障碍物。": "Try move(0, 3), followed by attack(0) on a new line. Finish moving before attacking; do not drive into the obstacle.",
	"摧毁障碍物即通关，无需到达绿色终点。射程不足或方向不对会挥空；灰色 void、墙体与已落下的闸门会挡住攻击。": "Destroy the obstacle to win. Out-of-range or misdirected strikes miss; void, walls and closed gates block attacks.",
	"objects 支持 timed_gate 闸门与 destructible 障碍；其他对象保留为扩展数据。player_spawn 可设为 null。\n模块使用 module_id 和 offset；extra 保存未知的顶层字段。": "objects supports timed_gate and destructible; other objects remain extension data. player_spawn may be null.\nModules use module_id and offset; extra preserves unknown root fields.",
	"机器出生占地与障碍物重叠。": "The machine spawn footprint overlaps an obstacle.",
	"attack 需要安装可用的近战模块。": "attack requires an available melee module.",

	"用一个移动模块沿上下对齐的 S 形道路抵达终点。两段上行都为 3 格。": "Follow the aligned S-shaped path with one movement module. Both upward sections are 3 tiles long.",
	"沿白色地板到达绿色终点，灰色区域是不可通行的 void。路线是右 4、上 3、左 4、上 3、右 4；请把它写成逐行执行的 move 指令。": "Follow the white floor to the green goal; gray areas are impassable void. The route is right 4, up 3, left 4, up 3, right 4. Write one move command per line.",
	"第二关 · 双驱动长廊": "Level 2 · Dual Drive",
	"在同一条 8 格长廊里，比较一个与两个移动模块的运行时间。": "Compare one and two movement modules on the same 8-tile corridor.",
	"这一关最多安装两个移动模块。先把第一个放在中心，再把第二个贴着它的边放置，例如偏移 (0.5, 0)。": "This level allows two movement modules. Place the first at the center and the second along its edge, for example at offset (0.5, 0).",
	"终点在右侧 8 格。一个移动模块的速度为 1 格/秒，两个相加为 2 格/秒。可以先用一个通关，再返回组装添加第二个，比较计时。": "The goal is 8 tiles to the right. One movement module travels at 1 tile/s; two add up to 2 tiles/s. Try one first, then return to assembly, add the second, and compare the times.",
	"本关没有倒计时或闸门。抵达终点即可通过；观察速度变化，理解相同模块如何叠加能力。": "There is no countdown or gate. Reach the goal to finish, and observe how identical modules add their capabilities.",
	"第三关 · 窄道转弯": "Level 3 · Narrow Turns",
	"让模块的完整占地穿过一格宽的转弯通道；试试小数距离。": "Guide the full module footprint through a one-tile-wide turn. Try fractional distances.",
	"每个移动模块占 0.5 × 0.5 格。建议把两个模块横向相连，偏移分别为 (0, 0) 和 (0.5, 0)；机器移动时不会自动旋转装配。": "Each movement module occupies 0.5 × 0.5 tiles. Try a horizontal pair at (0, 0) and (0.5, 0). Moving does not rotate the assembly.",
	"通道只有一格宽，碰撞会检查两个模块的完整矩形，不能只看中心十字。灰色 void 不能进入，也不能越过。": "The corridor is one tile wide. Collision checks both full module rectangles, not just the center cross. Gray void cannot be entered or crossed.",
	"横向双模块可先向右 1.75 格，再向上 6 格，最后向右 6.25 格。小数距离能让整台机器与窄道对齐；也可以用一个模块探索其他路线。": "For a horizontal pair, move right 1.75, up 6, then right 6.25 tiles. Fractional distances align the full machine with the corridor. You may also explore other routes with a single module.",
	"组装灵感，编写行动。": "Build an idea. Put it in motion.",
