	"教程": "Tutorial",
	"欢迎来到第一关。请先在空白组装区域放置一个移动模块，确认装配后再编写程序。此关最多携带一个模块。": "Welcome to Level 1. Place one movement module in the empty assembly area, confirm the assembly, then write your program. This level allows one module.",
